# Launch checklist

Work through this before a release and record the go/no-go decision at the
bottom. Replace or extend the items to fit the project; an unchecked item is a
blocker until it is either done or explicitly waived.

## Readiness

- [ ] All launch-gate controls are green or waived (`factory audit --gate launch`)
- [ ] Runbooks exist for the alerts that can fire on day one
- [ ] Rollback path is documented and has been exercised
- [ ] On-call owner and escalation path are named
- [ ] Monitoring and alerting cover the golden signals
- [ ] Backups are configured and a restore has been tested
- [ ] Privacy policy / terms are published (if the product has users)
- [ ] Support channel is live and staffed

## Go / no-go

- Decision date:
- Decision (go / no-go):
- Decided by:
- Outstanding risks accepted:
